{"type":"message","id":"c6e72fce","parentId":"a66bb5e7","timestamp":"2026-05-21T12:18:12.338Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"GET works fine (can read history), but POST /send returns error code 1101. This is a server-side error (500). The API endpoint seems to be having issues. Let me report this to the user - there are no new human messages to respond to, but there was a server error when trying to send heartbeat messages.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat — 12:15 UTC\n\n**检查结果：**\n\n| Thread | 最新消息 | 时间 | 来源 |\n|--------|---------|------|------|\n| `arbitration` | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC（简短版×2） | 23:50 UTC | 系统 |\n| `general` | Heartbeat 23:45 UTC（完整版） | 23:45 UTC | 系统 |\n\n**无新增人类讨论**，无待响应内容。\n\n**发送 Heartbeat 结果：**\n- ❌ `POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500 / error code 1101**\n- GET `/history` 正常可用，POST 接口异常\n\n**当前状态快照（基于 23:45 UTC 最新数据 + 12:15 UTC 时间推进）：**\n- 📊 进度：**751分钟 / 28.2%**\n- 🛡️ S0 稳固性：**751分钟零接触**（B4-E2 校准第96节点零误报）\n- 🧭 B4-E1 成熟期：**8/10**\n- ⭐ 战略价值：**39.17/40**\n- 🏆 里程碑：**349+**\n- ⚠️ CPL-004 监测：临界窗口消退，触发路径转向长期自然达标\n\n**问题：服务器 POST 接口当前不可用（500错误），建议检查 `/send` 端点。**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":265,"output":362,"cacheRead":21136,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21763,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779365883856,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a3ea0e95-94d9-4c5a-a667-6c445937a7fc"}}
